# Components

- Add `"use client"` when using hooks, Redux, events, or browser APIs.
- Merge classes with `cn()` from `@/lib/cn` — not raw template strings for conflicting Tailwind.
- Use CSS token classes: `bg-(--color-brand)`, `text-(--color-text-muted)`.
- Reuse primitives: `Button`, `DialogBox`, `DialogBottom` in `src/components/common/`.
- Icons: `lucide-react` only.
- Props: prefer `interface {Name}Props`; match export style of nearest sibling (named in `components/`, default in many `page.tsx`).
- Section comments: `// ─── Label ───`
- Mobile shell: authenticated pages render inside `AppShell` (430px frame).

Details: `/docs/ai-context/05-COMPONENT-PATTERNS-AND-CODING-STANDARDS.md`
